# Orby production environment — copy to Vercel / GitHub Actions (do not commit real secrets).

# ── GitHub Actions (repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions) ────────
# Variables (public — baked into static HTML at build time):
BUG_REPORT_API_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.vercel.app/api/bug-report
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0xYOUR_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY

# Optional — stats page; defaults to BUG_REPORT_API_URL with /api/stats if omitted:
# ORBY_STATS_API_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.vercel.app/api/stats

# Studio shell passphrase (ORBY_SR_PHRASE) is retired — leave unset / delete the Actions secret.

# ── Vercel (Project → Settings → Environment Variables → Production) ───────────
# Email (Resend — domain must be verified in Resend dashboard):
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx
BUG_REPORT_TO=orby-admin@proton.me
RESEND_FROM=Orby <reports@your-verified-domain.com>

# CORS — lock API to your public site (required for production launch):
BUG_REPORT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://orby.studio,https://www.orby.studio

# Turnstile — secret must pair with TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY in GitHub Actions:
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=0xYOUR_TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY

# Rate limits (Upstash Redis — recommended):
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://YOUR-INSTANCE.upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=YOUR_UPSTASH_TOKEN

# ── Launch checklist ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [ ] GitHub variable BUG_REPORT_API_URL set → redeploy Pages after change
# [ ] GitHub variable TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY set → matches Vercel TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
# [ ] GitHub secret ORBY_SR_PHRASE deleted if still present (gate retired; site is open)
# [ ] Vercel RESEND_* + BUG_REPORT_TO configured; send a test bug report
# [ ] Vercel BUG_REPORT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS lists orby.studio (+ www if used)
# [ ] Vercel Upstash vars set (rate limit); spam-test POST returns 429 after burst
# [ ] npm run build on CI prints "Production env check passed"
